00:21:16.920 --> 00:21:17.880
Congratulations.

00:21:17.880 --> 00:21:21.580
Lucky! You're so lucky! I wanna home run too!

00:21:21.580 --> 00:21:23.210
About today, I...
You just keep striking out!

00:21:23.710 --> 00:21:28.380
will probably never forget the taste of the
Choco Bat that I ate together with everyone.

00:21:30.790 --> 00:21:32.000
Big Sis.

00:21:32.000 --> 00:21:35.460
Please stop preserving anything
and everything in formalin!

00:21:36.500 --> 00:21:38.130
Probably for the rest of my life...

